{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33658","headline":"览张骞传 · 邵谒","name":"览张骞传","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采药不得根，寻河不得源。\n此时虚白首，徒感武皇恩。\n桑田未闻改，日月曾几昏。\n仙骨若求得，垄头无新坟。\n不见杜陵草，至今空自繁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邵谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}